  "capacity_note": "Printed meter is 2/4 throughout; only the system-1 opening glyph on both staves. Complete 2/4 = 2 quarter-note units. P001 is an opening pickup of two beamed sixteenths (double beams), together one eighth (capacity 1/2), after the 2/4 glyph and before the first measure barline at x=440. Those notes are not two eighths and not a one-quarter pickup. P009 is three eighths (capacity 3/2) before the first-strain backward repeat. P001 (1 eighth) plus P009 (3 eighths) complete one 2/4. P010 is two beamed sixteenths totaling one eighth (capacity 1/2) after the system-3 forward repeat. Those notes are not two eighths and not a one-quarter pickup. P033 is three eighths (capacity 3/2) before the second-strain backward repeat. P010 plus P033 complete one 2/4. Both strains have conventional pickup-plus-terminal pairing against the printed meter.",
